abstract: >
  Teaching module for machine design courses based on Shigley. A Simulink model
  of a passenger EV produces motor torque and speed for three load cases
  (FTP-75 city cycle, hill climb, full-throttle launch), from which students
  design a single-speed, two-stage helical gearbox with the procedures of
  Shigley's Mechanical Engineering Design, 11th edition. Supported by the
  MathWorks Teaching Support Award.
keywords:
